WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.866
When an offer looks wrong, separate the campaign rule,
storefront presentation and Shopify checkout. Write

2
00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:12.124
down the expected product, quantity, price, country,
currency and code. Begin with a fresh controlled cart

3
00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:18.381
and the exact theme being tested. Check active status,
schedule, selected items and thresholds first. A

4
00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:24.639
missing widget does not prove that the discount
calculation failed, and a visible widget does not

5
00:00:24.639 --> 00:00:26.594
prove that the offer qualifies.

6
00:00:27.644 --> 00:00:34.580
Open Settings, then Advanced cart integration. We are
only inspecting these fields and will not save a

7
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:40.291
change. Grey selector examples are placeholders, not
proof they match your theme. Container selectors

8
00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:47.227
identify the drawer or cart wrapper; line selectors
identify each repeated item. Section IDs use the part

9
00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:53.347
after shopify-section. Use stable theme selectors, not
generated classes or product names, and change one

10
00:00:53.347 --> 00:00:55.387
verified value at a time.

11
00:00:56.437 --> 00:01:04.997
Auto is the normal starting point. Replace sections is
for themes where the returned Shopify HTML is safe to

12
00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:11.755
swap. Theme events only is for drawers whose own
JavaScript handles refresh. Per-theme embed overrides

13
00:01:11.755 --> 00:01:20.766
can differ from global settings, so inspect the exact
preview. A refresh change is not a cure for a missing

14
00:01:20.766 --> 00:01:26.172
product selection, stock restriction, incompatible
code or incorrect currency threshold. Keep existing

15
00:01:26.172 --> 00:01:29.326
working settings until the failure is reproducible.

16
00:01:30.376 --> 00:01:37.942
After any justified change, test add, remove, add
again and remove again, including manual gift removal

17
00:01:37.942 --> 00:01:45.508
and an unchanged-cart reload. Check for duplicates,
stale totals, loops and quantities changing on the way

18
00:01:45.508 --> 00:01:52.601
to checkout. For a report, include time and timezone,
campaign, variants, quantities, market, code, expected

19
00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:59.694
result and redacted screenshots. Gift diagnostics can
help support, but never share cart tokens, addresses

20
00:01:59.694 --> 00:02:05.841
or payment information. Our guide provides the
checklist; this walkthrough changes no integration

21
00:02:05.841 --> 00:02:06.314
setting.
